n: center\">Each update will aim to improve and expand on the game, without losing the core focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","short_description":"Build, create and manage your island! Combine crops, animals and helpers with unique modifiers and upgrades. Play a farming and management game, where each level has different possibilitie and challenges, including Animals, Pirates, Satues, and more. Start creating your beautiful pixel art world!","supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/18316434e91a4a1c8fa34005aa7a96828a5610f0/header.jpg?t=1784931239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/7e5f50e428cc4f8c5a03b8405f7f5bb4b4fc5f6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784931239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132700/7e5f50e428cc4f8c5a03b8405f7f5bb4b4fc5f6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784931239","website":"https://www.extrinc.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  x86_64 CPU or ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full OpenGL 3.3 support or Direct3D 11 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU with 4 physical cores or more or ARMv8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics with full OpenGL 4.6 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"